    "action": "Generated seven RHF/STO-3G ionic geometries with every real SCF density frame, analytic nuclear gradients and six verified 0.5 fs Velocity Verlet updates. The first ten seconds now show two complete SCF cycles; the last five show four rapid ionic steps. Density is a residual-driven sparse-to-fine 2D contour projection, while every atom, two-colour bond and proportional-head vector is rendered by MatterVis under one fixed oblique camera. Phase labels, pauses and atom-centred olive, emerald and lake-blue vectors were checked at final size and across all 360 frames.",
